{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SN\u00d8 is a simple game about downhill skiing. Carve your way down procedurally generated mountainscapes and try to score as many points as possible by pulling off high-risk proximity maneuvers and tricks. Mastering the controls and terrain is key to achieving high scores, making every run a test of skill and flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943150/extras/62080411cbe85c7127947b9bdbed6172.poster.avif?t=1772786586\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943150/extras/62080411cbe85c7127947b9bdbed6172.webm?t=1772786586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943150/extras/62080411cbe85c7127947b9bdbed6172.mp4?t=1772786586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SN\u00d8 offers endless procedural mountains to explore. Choose whether you want to chase the top spots on the leaderboards, or just enjoy the ride in Zen mode.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Message from the creators:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SN\u00d8 is made in Norway by two people. We designed it to capture the essence of downhill skiing in a minimalistic and playful way.\u00a0SN\u00d8 is perfect for short gameplay sessions, focusing on rewarding gameplay systems, instant action and smooth controls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special message to all Steamdeck users:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have optimized SN\u00d8 for the Steamdeck. The game runs at 60-90 FPS on High quality settings. Enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things you will find in this game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and smooth freeriding gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless procedurally generated mountains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three ride styles: Skis, Snowboard and Sit-ski</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless skins requiring skill to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share and revisit mountains by seed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keyboard and gamepad support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Zen-mode - No scoring, just you and the mountain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online global and friends leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit top scoring mountains directly from the leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person, third person and drone camera modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things you will not find</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepped slopes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loading times</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Born with skis on your legs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943150/1daeaa34d4ac70a3b1fcead2f1f2e3795713f357.jpg"},{"name":"Yard Sale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943150/f2290822b4c82489f63543c3e6a1097f587e3401.jpg"},{"name":"C-C-C-Combo!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943150/e5fe0374514ff27373cc3f604e52d8087c8c7e1e.jpg"},{"name":"The Ultimate Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943150/06e6a8a9600b287f14641d2b1579a9e3a001b9a0.jpg"},{"name":"Powder Hound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic